// Ch4 C4-12, bark 2 of 3: the galley's hourglass. Ysolde notes the time on it (she reads everything).
// Field bark. The hour matches Ch1: the Seventh Terrace cast off at 11:10 (M4-A2P-116 B6).
title: ch04_bark_hourglass
location: ch04/brightwater_ferry
---
Ysolde [neutral]: The glass was turned at the morning watch and never again. Three days ago, a little after eleven. #line:ch04_bark_glass_001
===
